{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["And the meaning of <b>ובקצרכם</b>: after the peace offering, just as you gave the fats to the Name, so shall you give from the harvest of your land for the honor of HaShem, to the poor and to the stranger. And a grammatical note: קצרכם is unusual, and it is a noun of action from the kal binyan." "<b>פאת שדך.</b> That one shall leave a corner in the field." "<b>ולקט.</b> Known."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:52.134708579Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}